+ * Backend selection:
+ *   - Windows default: WASAPI (via mmdeviceapi)
+ *   - Everywhere else / if PS3RECOMP_AUDIO_USE_SDL2 defined: SDL2 audio
+ *
+ * Define PS3RECOMP_AUDIO_USE_SDL2 to force SDL2 backend on Windows.
