+ * 0x100): runs a second, ms of lane time a second, average and longest run in us. Wall time on
+ * the lane, so a job whose lane was preempted counts that wait too. The main thread waits on
+ * these jobs for about two thirds of a heavy frame on the Thor: this says which.
