+ * lanes, the render thread, the Vulkan worker and the sound kernel; at the same priority, a record
+ * the main thread posts can sit until another thread's time slice ends while the main thread
+ * waits on it. RACACIT_PINGPONG=0: none of it; RACACIT_PINGPONG_NICE (-10; 0 = no priority).
+ * (The lane moved onto the main thread's core for the job -- RACACIT_COLOC, .17 and .23-.26 -- is
+ * gone: measured worse both times, .17 Space Sector 1 at 11 fps, .26 the title screen 60 -> 44.) */
